# Compatible with:
# - Node.js 24.x LTS with enhanced environment variable handling
# - Express.js 5.1.0 with modern security features and performance improvements
# - npm 11.x package manager with enhanced security and performance features
# - V8 Engine 13.6 with latest ECMAScript features and security enhancements
#
# ==============================================================================